1
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:14,880
With throwing knives,

2
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,440
keep a steady eye and a precise hand.

3
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,719
Strike quickly

4
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,960
to catch them off guard.

5
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,079
Give it a try.

6
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,200
Pretty accurate for your first knife throw.

7
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:37,280
Not bad.

8
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:38,320
Let me try.

9
00:00:45,799 --> 00:00:46,399
One more time.

10
00:00:57,759 --> 00:00:59,719
Missing once or twice doesn't matter.

11
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:01,880
As long as you keep practicing,

12
00:01:02,679 --> 00:01:04,480
you'll hit the bullseye every time.

13
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,079
Chief!

14
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,879
Dad, are you in your room?

15
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,560
Dad, we've come to see you!

16
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,079
Dad!

17
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,640
Lian Ye, how dare you murder the Chief!

18
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,239
Dad!

19
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,359
Lian Ye, you bastard!

20
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,719
Dad! Dad!

21
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:43,359
Spread the word!

22
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,959
Vermilion Bird Hall Master Lian Ye murdered the Chief!

23
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,439
Dad... Capture him and avenge the Chief!

24
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:49,560
Yes, sir!

25
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,239
Dad!

26
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,159
Dad!

27
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,599
Don't scare me, Dad!

28
00:01:58,359 --> 00:01:59,560
Dad!

29
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:02,439
Please wake up, Dad!

30
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,199
What happened?

31
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,719
Someone murdered the Chief

32
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:32,319
and framed me.

33
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,280
They're saying I'm the suspect.

34
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:37,280
The Sanshan Gang is powerful.

35
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:39,639
No ordinary person would dare touch Chief Hu.

36
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,560
The killer framed you,

37
00:02:42,039 --> 00:02:44,520
costing the Sanshan Gang two top leaders at once.

38
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:45,879
Killing two birds with one stone.

39
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,759
There must be a major scheme behind this.

40
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:57,159
The Japanese seized our fishing boats.

41
00:02:58,159 --> 00:03:01,039
The Chief went to meet their delegates today.

42
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,599
I should've gone with him.

43
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,159
If only I had gone,

44
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:06,319
the Chief would've been safe.

45
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:07,400
He wouldn't have died.

46
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,159
This isn't your fault.

47
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,960
What matters most right now

48
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:15,400
is finding the real culprit.

49
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:21,800
Right.

50
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:27,319
The Japanese are definitely behind this.

51
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,960
Dad...

52
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:34,599
How could you leave me all alone, Dad?

53
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:35,879
Baozhu.

54
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,719
We can't bring back the dead.

55
00:03:38,639 --> 00:03:39,479
You have to stay strong.

56
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,360
Uncle Yan promises you,

57
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,240
I will definitely catch Lian Ye

58
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,759
and avenge Chief Hu!

59
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:47,080
Get out.

60
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,400
Uncle Yan,

61
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,199
I just want to be alone with my dad.

62
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,039
Lian Ye,

63
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:07,960
my father treated you so well.

64
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,520
Why did you kill him?

65
00:04:21,639 --> 00:04:23,519
Business is booming, Boss Chen.

66
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,839
Thank you for the kind words.

67
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,319
Lian Ye, get out here right now!

68
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,959
Go room by room.

69
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:29,879
Search everywhere!

70
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,160
Search! Search!

71
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,600
Open up! Open the door!

72
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,399
Open the door! Open up!

73
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:34,319
Miss Hu...

74
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:34,879
Open the door!

75
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,720
Did I offend you somehow?

76
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,560
What are you doing?

77
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,560
Who is it?

78
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,160
There's no one by that name here.

79
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:39,879
We don't know him.

80
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,720
Open up! Where is he?

81
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:41,560
Where is he?

82
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:42,600
Hand over Lian Ye!

83
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,040
He's not here.

84
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,439
Who are you kidding?

85
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:47,040
You're his childhood friend!

86
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,720
He's a murderer now.

87
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,560
I suggest you cooperate.

88
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,600
Miss Hu,

89
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,920
I won't stop you from seeking revenge,

90
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:56,199
but don't disrupt my business.

91
00:04:58,839 --> 00:05:01,040
Lian Ye, you listen to me!

92
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,639
My father saved your life

93
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,079
and raised you with care.

94
00:05:04,519 --> 00:05:06,319
Yet you betrayed him and took his life!

95
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,959
The Sanshan Gang won't forgive you,

96
00:05:08,319 --> 00:05:09,360
and neither will I!

97
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,920
If Hall Master Zhuang hadn't said

98
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:14,279
my father grew furious meeting the Japanese,

99
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,800
and we hadn't gone to console him,

100
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,000
uncovering your plot,

101
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:21,639
you would have gotten away with it!

102
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:23,759
Miss Hu,

103
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,639
if you don't take your men out of Club Jasmine,

104
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,759
I'm calling the police.

105
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,879
Miss, we didn't find him.

106
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,000
No need to call them.

107
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:38,519
I'll go to the police station myself

108
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,439
and have Li Mingyuan arrest Lian Ye!

109
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,639
Let's go!

110
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,720
Come out.

111
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,759
What Hu Baozhu said...

112
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,560
You heard it all.

113
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:09,160
The killer colluded with the Japanese

114
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,560
to murder the Chief.

115
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,839
What were they really trying to achieve?

116
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:20,439
I'm going out.

117
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,560
Be careful.

118
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:36,759
Everyone,

119
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,839
Chief Hu has fallen,

120
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,639
and my heart aches with grief!

121
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:43,360
He founded the Sanshan Gang himself,

122
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:45,079
leading us brothers

123
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:47,439
to expand the Sanshan Gang,

124
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,800
making it the greatest gang in Rongcheng!

125
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:53,040
I will certainly avenge Chief Hu!

126
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:56,399
Yet the Sanshan Gang cannot go a day without a chief!

127
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,240
The new chief will lead us

128
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:01,000
to carry on Chief Hu's legacy,

129
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,839
punishing evil and upholding justice!

130
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,319
Everyone!

131
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:08,160
Vice Chief Yan poured his soul into the Sanshan Gang,

132
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,240
and his contributions are immense!

133
00:07:09,639 --> 00:07:10,399
I propose

134
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,079
that Vice Chief Yan

135
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:13,240
succeed as our chief!

136
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,639
What do you all say?

137
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:17,480
I agree!

138
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,240
I agree too!

139
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,720
Agreed!

140
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:23,480
Agreed! Agreed! Agreed!

141
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,720
Since this is what you all desire,

142
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,839
I, Yan, shall not decline!

143
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,759
Greetings, Chief Yan.

144
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:44,319
Greetings, Chief Yan.

145
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,480
Please rise.

146
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,879
Rest assured, brothers.

147
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,879
I will definitely catch Lian Ye

148
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,480
and avenge Chief Hu!

149
00:07:53,879 --> 00:07:54,360
Chief,

150
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:56,600
there's an urgent matter that needs your decision.

151
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:58,879
The Japanese attacked Pingtan Island,

152
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,800
and refugees are flooding into Rongcheng,

153
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,800
seeking help from the Sanshan Gang.

154
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:03,319
How should we settle them?

155
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,879
They're our fellow townsfolk.

156
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,800
Let them join the Sanshan Gang

157
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:10,000
and become one of us.

158
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:13,040
Handle the specifics yourself.

159
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,560
Yes, Chief.

160
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,680
Li Mingyuan!

161
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:20,879
What are you doing? Li Mingyuan! What are you guys doing?

162
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,639
Get out of the way! Get out!

163
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,480
Li Mingyuan! / Who do you think you are?

164
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,360
You think you can just see our Deputy Director?

165
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,360
Get out here!

166
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,279
Li Mingyuan!

167
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,040
Shut your mouth!

168
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:29,920
What's all the racket?

169
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,360
Li Mingyuan, you're just in time.

170
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,200
Lian Ye killed my father!

171
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:41,679
Go arrest him right now!

172
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,679
Lian Ye killed Hu Xiaoshan?

173
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:45,399
I saw it with my own eyes!

174
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,279
The other Hall Masters saw it too!

175
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,360
He's the killer!

176
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,360
Director Li,

177
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,440
how about I go instead?

178
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:51,440
No way!

179
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,159
Lian Ye is his childhood friend.

180
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,919
I must watch him investigate this in person

181
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,639
to prevent any favoritism!

182
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,480
What's that supposed to mean?

183
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,159
Enough.

184
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,960
The Sanshan Gang has many fishermen.

185
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,720
Chief Hu's death has a huge impact.

186
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:04,360
I'll investigate thoroughly myself.

187
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,840
Go notify Coroner Yan Jin.

188
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:08,480
Tell him to come with me to the Sanshan Gang.

189
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:09,759
Yes, Director Li.

190
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,519
The victim died around nine last night.

191
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:30,879
A throwing knife pierced the heart.

192
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,679
Killed in a single strike.

193
00:09:32,039 --> 00:09:33,120
There were no signs of a struggle.

194
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,279
The killer was clearly someone the victim knew.

195
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,919
The victim was completely off guard.

196
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:41,679
Who in the Sanshan Gang uses throwing knives?

197
00:09:42,159 --> 00:09:43,039
Too many to count.

198
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:43,960
Me,

199
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,480
Lian Ye,

200
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:45,440
Vice Chief Yan,

201
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:47,159
and the other three Hall Masters.

202
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:48,960
You do?

203
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,039
I do.

204
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,159
Since I'm already here,

205
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,399
show me around the Sanshan Gang.

206
00:09:55,679 --> 00:09:56,399
Let's look for clues.

207
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:58,159
Need one more at Pier Three!

208
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,000
Who's going?

209
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,399
Me! Me! Me!

210
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,639
Who's the new Sanshan Gang chief?

211
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,039
Yan Baichuan.

212
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,440
Who's he?

213
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,240
Black Tortoise Hall Master, Zhuang Liancheng.

214
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,279
Still need one at Pier Five! Who's going?

215
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:20,120
Me! Pier Five, I'm going!

216
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:26,279
Who are they?

217
00:10:26,879 --> 00:10:28,519
They're refugees from Pingtan Island,

218
00:10:28,799 --> 00:10:29,720
seeking refuge with the Sanshan Gang.

219
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,720
Come on, let's take a look ahead.

220
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,279
Boss,

221
00:10:58,799 --> 00:10:59,519
an oyster omelet, please.

222
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:00,600
Coming right up!

223
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:01,879
Extra oysters on mine!

224
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:03,240
Sure thing.

225
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,799
He's Lian Ye's shadow.

226
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:05,759
He'll definitely go to him.

227
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:09,120
Chief Yan put a 100-silver-dollar bounty on Lian Ye.

228
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,960
The moment we spot Lian Ye, we cash in.

229
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:12,840
You bet.

230
00:11:19,279 --> 00:11:19,799
Come again!

231
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:21,879
Last night,

232
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,039
the boy who told me to see the Chief...

233
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,600
Did you find him?

234
00:11:27,559 --> 00:11:28,080
No.

235
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,519
The killer probably hid him away.

236
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,559
When Chief Hu met with the Japanese,

237
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,159
did anything happen?

238
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:37,320
I asked the men who accompanied him yesterday.

239
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:38,519
He said...

240
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:40,080
Chief Hu,

241
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:41,799
I've heard so much about you.

242
00:11:42,679 --> 00:11:43,480
Mr. Matsui,

243
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,919
a pleasure to meet you.

244
00:11:47,559 --> 00:11:48,120
Please, have a seat.

245
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,360
Knowing Chief Hu would grace my humble abode today,

246
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,480
I specifically had my men prepare

247
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:03,120
some of the finest Rongcheng jasmine tea.

248
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:05,600
This is the first harvest of early spring,

249
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:08,000
a rare tea you can only taste once a year.

250
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:10,120
Chief Hu, please have a taste.

251
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:11,360
Thank you.

252
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:17,879
The Major General entrusted me to negotiate with you,

253
00:12:19,159 --> 00:12:22,320
and deeply apologizes for seizing the boats.

254
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,519
You're too kind, Mr. Matsui.

255
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,399
I only hope the Japanese side will return the boats.

256
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:33,039
They are the fishermen's livelihood.

257
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,720
They cannot survive without them.

258
00:12:35,279 --> 00:12:36,559
You make a valid point, Chief Hu.

259
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:39,399
That is why the Major General is willing to return them.

260
00:12:39,759 --> 00:12:40,480
However...

261
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:44,159
We hope Chief Hu can grant us

262
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:45,480
one small request.

263
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,000
Go ahead.

264
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,440
Could Chief Hu rally the fishermen

265
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,320
to cooperate with the Japanese side

266
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,559
and transport supplies for Japan?

267
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:58,279
What do you mean by that?

268
00:12:59,919 --> 00:13:01,039
Rest assured, Chief Hu.

269
00:13:02,039 --> 00:13:03,159
As for the compensation,

270
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,519
it will be exceptionally generous.

271
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:07,080
We definitely won't shortchange the fishermen.

272
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:09,000
It was never about the money!

273
00:13:10,279 --> 00:13:12,360
You Japanese seized the fishing boats without cause.

274
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:13,720
It was highly disrespectful.

275
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:15,919
Returning the boats is merely your obligation.

276
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:19,039
Demanding that we transport your supplies...

277
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:22,080
Do you want them to curse me, Hu Xiaoshan,

278
00:13:22,399 --> 00:13:23,240
for selling out to Japan

279
00:13:23,559 --> 00:13:24,960
and becoming your lapdog?

280
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,519
That was never my intention.

281
00:13:27,919 --> 00:13:31,320
The Major General simply wishes to work with the Sanshan Gang.

282
00:13:32,559 --> 00:13:33,559
I must refuse.

283
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,519
The Japanese side shows no sincerity in these talks.

284
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:40,720
There is no reason for us to continue this discussion.

285
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:41,639
Let's go.

286
00:13:49,039 --> 00:13:51,320
What a waste of such fine jasmine tea.

287
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:59,120
Those bastards!

288
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,960
They actually wanted the Sanshan Gang to ship supplies

289
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:01,759
to fight fellow Chinese!

290
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:02,960
They're pushing their luck.

291
00:14:03,879 --> 00:14:05,639
Boss, don't burn it!

292
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,519
You got it, don't worry!

293
00:14:09,039 --> 00:14:10,480
Jiichiro Matsui...

294
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:13,600
Has anything else happened in the gang lately?

295
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,519
Old Man Yan took over as Chief.

296
00:14:17,879 --> 00:14:18,279
Oh, right.

297
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:20,360
Hall Master Zhuang recently took in a group

298
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,480
of refugees from Pingtan,

299
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,440
and assigned them to work at various docks.

300
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:24,679
Come here.

301
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:28,000
From now on, do everything exactly as I say.

302
00:14:29,279 --> 00:14:30,039
Thanks, Boss.

303
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:32,840
Let's go.

304
00:14:33,159 --> 00:14:33,559
Let's move.

305
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,200
Mr. Matsui.

306
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,360
It's been a while.

307
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,639
Instead of running for your life,

308
00:15:03,039 --> 00:15:04,240
what are you doing here?

309
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:07,159
I'm here to finish this game with you.
